{"id":"motivo","lemma":"motivo","pos":"noun","rank":932,"glosses":["reason, ground, motive"],"ipa":"/moˈtibo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"motivos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-motivo.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cuál podría ser el motivo?","en":"What could be the reason?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/600072","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"El motivo es claro.","en":"The reason is clear.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450270","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"clear"}]},{"text":"Teníamos nuestros motivos.","en":"We had our reasons.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501577","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},null]},{"text":"Quiero saber el motivo.","en":"I want to know the reason.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734343","words":[{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to know, to understand"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"No veo motivo para parar.","en":"I see no reason to stop.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/296576","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"to stop, halt"}]}]}